  1    0.01650 False   -1.442     QPSK 1/4   -1.442   -4.987         None False  0.0000
  2    0.02645 False    0.608     QPSK 2/5    0.608   -2.937         None False  0.0000
  3    0.04737 False    3.138     QPSK 3/5    3.138   -0.407     QPSK 1/4  True  0.4085
